<title>USA: TENNIS-LIPTON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LIPTON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KEY BISCAYNE, Fla. 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$4.45 million Lipton Championships on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles, semifinals</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat 1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) 5-7 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-4</p>
</text>
